{{!
    @template theme_tresa/frontpage-ticker
    Front page rotating highlight banner - a thin strip crossfading between
    a few short taglines (see lib.php:
    theme_tresa_get_frontpage_ticker_context()). Same crossfade technique as
    the hero banner's own multi-image autoscroll (see scripts.mustache).

    Context: ticker.slides [{text, first}].

    Dot-notation ("ticker.slides") - see frontpage-steps.mustache's
    docblock for why (same partial-sharing-the-parent's-whole-context
    reason): a bare, undotted section name would look for a top-level
    "slides" key, which doesn't exist - only the nested one does. That
    docblock also explains why no literal double-brace syntax should ever
    be written in this comment as an illustrative example.
}}
<div class="tresa-ticker" data-tresa-ticker>
    <div class="tresa-ticker__inner">
        {{#ticker.slides}}
        <p class="tresa-ticker__slide{{#first}} is-active{{/first}}">{{text}}</p>
        {{/ticker.slides}}
    </div>
</div>
